    "body": "You could try using the `starship config` command to enable and disable the notification something like\n```\nTRAPALRM​ () {\n  ​#​ regenerate the prompt​\n  starship config show_notifications false \n  starship_render\n  starship config show_notifications true \n  zle reset-prompt\n}\n```\n\nI haven't tested this so might need some tweaking. ",
